        <section id="what-is-lean-project-management?"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>What is Lean project management?</h2>
              <p>‘Lean’ originated as part of manufacturing practices but has now transformed the areas of knowledge and management.</p>
<p>The five principles of Lean are:</p>

              
              <!-- IF 2 --><ul class="l-icon-grid ">
  
  
    
    <!--  -->
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s3_p2_reveal1.svg" alt="Defining value" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Defining value</h3>
      <p>This is what the customer is willing to pay for. What they need and what they can afford to pay.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s3_p2_reveal2.svg" alt="Mapping the value stream" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Mapping the value stream</h3>
      <p>Activities that do not add the value to the end customer are considered as waste.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s3_p2_reveal3.svg" alt="Creating flow" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Creating flow</h3>
      <p>After removing waste, the remaining steps should flow and run smoothly without interruptions.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s3_p2_reveal4.svg" alt="Using the pull system" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Using the pull system</h3>
      <p>The pull-based system limits inventory and allows for just in time delivery.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s3_p2_reveal5.svg" alt="Pursuing perfection" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Pursuing perfection</h3>
      <p>Continuous process improvement helps striving for perfection whilst meeting the clients needs.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
  
</ul>

            
          
